            "text": "Uchta tugma: +1, −1 va tozalash.",
            "code": "function Counter() {\n  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <p>{count}</p>\n      <button onClick={() => setCount(count + 1)}>+1</button>\n      <button onClick={() => setCount(count - 1)}>-1</button>\n      <button onClick={() => setCount(0)}>Tozalash</button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}"
          },
          {
            "quote": true,
            "text": "Agar `count` oddiy o'zgaruvchi bo'lsa, xotiradagi qiymat o'zgarsa ham ekran yangilanmasdi. Shuning uchun `useState` kerak."
